{"unit_id":"Instant-KING__dsh-ai-library#card-zh","repo":"Instant-KING/dsh-ai-library","commit":"811775da9495f746da884e49fe6b2ef577977bdc","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ai-library 是面向 DSH Web 和桌面客户端的本地资料馆面板。它通过 DSH 面板插槽提供分类浏览、卡片列表和文件预览，并注册 AI 工具与入库提示词。主要功能包括搜索和阅读本机文件、管理资料条目、导入与自动收集文件、检索论文和网页并保存快照，以及提交 PDF 翻译任务。适合希望把工作产物、论文和参考网页集中整理并再次查找的 DSH 用户。基础资料库不需要额外账号；网页搜索可匿名使用，DeepSeek 抓取和 PDF 翻译等增强功能需要相应密钥或本机服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:5275","lib/index.js:1248","lib/tools.js:1392","lib/tools.js:1892"]}
{"unit_id":"Instant-KING__dsh-ai-library#card-en","repo":"Instant-KING/dsh-ai-library","commit":"811775da9495f746da884e49fe6b2ef577977bdc","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ai-library adds a local DSH panel for organizing and searching files, previewing documents, importing work, and collecting papers or web pages. It saves page snapshots and submits PDFs for translation. Basic use needs no account; optional features use web keys or a local translation service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:5275","lib/index.js:1248","lib/tools.js:1392","lib/tools.js:1892"]}
