{"unit_id":"Instant-KING__dsh-ai-library#feature-file-import","repo":"Instant-KING/dsh-ai-library","commit":"811775da9495f746da884e49fe6b2ef577977bdc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ai-library 的功能「批量导入文件」：扫描指定文件或目录，将文档、图片等产物复制到资料库并建立条目。可先用 dryRun 预览将导入的内容，再确认写入。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:274","lib/tools.js:345"]}
{"unit_id":"Instant-KING__dsh-ai-library#feature-autocapture","repo":"Instant-KING/dsh-ai-library","commit":"811775da9495f746da884e49fe6b2ef577977bdc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ai-library 的功能「增量自动收集」：扫描配置目录，只把上次扫描后新增或变更的文件加入资料馆，并记录扫描水位。调用 library_autocapture 可按需运行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:601","lib/tools.js:698"]}
{"unit_id":"Instant-KING__dsh-ai-library#feature-search","repo":"Instant-KING/dsh-ai-library","commit":"811775da9495f746da884e49fe6b2ef577977bdc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ai-library 的功能「资料搜索和阅读」：AI 可按标题、摘要、标签等元数据查找，也可全文检索 Markdown、文本和 PDF 并返回片段；另可读取条目文件或指定 PDF 页。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:1392","lib/tools.js:1501"]}
{"unit_id":"Instant-KING__dsh-ai-library#feature-paper-search","repo":"Instant-KING/dsh-ai-library","commit":"811775da9495f746da884e49fe6b2ef577977bdc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ai-library 的功能「多源论文检索」：从 arXiv、OpenAlex、Crossref 等学术来源查询并归一化论文信息；通过 library_paper_add 可将选中的记录存为资料条目。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:467","lib/tools.js:499","lib/paper.js:1"]}
{"unit_id":"Instant-KING__dsh-ai-library#feature-web-search-save","repo":"Instant-KING/dsh-ai-library","commit":"811775da9495f746da884e49fe6b2ef577977bdc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ai-library 的功能「网页检索与收藏」：搜索网页后可将链接正文保存为本地 Markdown 快照；可传入已抽取的 Markdown，或选择可用的在线抓取方式。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:712","lib/tools.js:1665"]}
{"unit_id":"Instant-KING__dsh-ai-library#feature-repo-build","repo":"Instant-KING/dsh-ai-library","commit":"811775da9495f746da884e49fe6b2ef577977bdc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ai-library 的功能「仓库建库」：给出 GitHub 仓库或本地目录后，扫描 README 与文档并创建可检索的馆藏条目，便于日后从资料库查找项目资料。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:1072"]}
{"unit_id":"Instant-KING__dsh-ai-library#feature-library-panel","repo":"Instant-KING/dsh-ai-library","commit":"811775da9495f746da884e49fe6b2ef577977bdc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ai-library 的功能「资料馆面板」：在 DSH 侧栏注册入口，提供分类与条目浏览；可在面板选择资料并查看文件预览，包括内置 PDF 阅读器。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:5275","lib/client.js:2333"]}
